# What the laptop does not upload to Vercel. Everything else is uploaded.
# The site needs data/dataset and data/results, so they are not listed here.
# This file exists so the upload does not depend on .gitignore, which hides the data from GitHub.

.env*
*.pem
.git
node_modules
.next
eval/answer_key.json
eval/ANSWER_KEY.md
eval/OPEN_LABELS.md
eval/cases.json
eval/report*.json
eval/reports
eval/fixtures
eval/make_fixture.mjs
data/results/*/run_log.jsonl
START_HERE.md
docs/PRD.md

# Stored model answers and other run files hold raw model output. They stay on the laptop (D18).
# The site needs only data/results/current.json.
data/results/*/

# Local screenshots show course data. They are never uploaded.
screenshots/
